# Brevo (Sendinblue) HTTPS API Configuration (Preferred for Render Free Tier)
# Render Free Web Services block outbound SMTP ports 25, 465, and 587.
# Brevo sends transactional emails over HTTPS port 443 with 300 free emails/day.
# Sign up at https://brevo.com, generate an API key (xkeysib-...), and configure:
BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib_your_brevo_api_key_here
EMAIL_FROM="VISARTECH People" <kumarabhinandan1307@gmail.com>

# Alternative Resend API Configuration (Optional)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here

